      "message": "chore: ignore backend/package-lock.json\n\nThe dev launcher runs npm install in backend on first use of a worktree, so the\ngenerated lockfile showed up as untracked in every new one. Nothing consumes it:\nthe Dockerfile installs backend deps with `npm install --omit=dev`, and only\nfrontend/package-lock.json is tracked (used by its `npm ci`).",
